# Build AppleBridgeWatchdog (the keep-alive helper).
# Run inside MPW from the AppleBridge project folder (MeinMac:MPW:AppleBridge:).
# watchdog.c goes in :src: alongside the daemon/config sources. It now reads the
# prefs HOME= key so it can launch the daemon wherever the installer put it, so it
# links prefs.c.o + mystring.c.o too (still no OT; StdCLib not needed — prefs.c is
# stdlib-free). Toolbox via Interface.o + MacRuntime.o.
SC -i :include: :src:watchdog.c -o :obj:watchdog.c.o
Link -model far -o :bin:AppleBridgeWatchdog :obj:watchdog.c.o :obj:prefs.c.o :obj:mystring.c.o "{Libraries}Interface.o" "{Libraries}MacRuntime.o"
Rez watchdog_res.r -a -o :bin:AppleBridgeWatchdog
SetFile -t APPL -c 'ABwd' :bin:AppleBridgeWatchdog
